  "_comment": [
    "Every item in the game, one record each (docs/gameplay/03_PLAYER_MENU.md section 5): map items, keys, consumables,",
    "weapons, armor, talents. type: consumable | key | weapon | armor | talent | story. name/desc are text.json keys.",
    "stats: what it gives (a consumable when used, gear while worn); any attribute id of stats.json works.",
    "price: its value in gold, also what the store charges. important: true = it cannot be dropped.",
    "autoUse: applied the moment it is picked up (coins; keys always are). Weapons/armor/talents also carry",
    "bar (battle-bar settings), talent and actives (granted skills)."
